WEBVTT

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.360
Senpai! Please stop!

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.000
Senpai...

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.570
Sorry to call you out so suddenly.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:40.120
But I can't hold it in any longer.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.330
Yuriko...

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:45.670
I can't hold back my feelings
for you any longer, Eruna!

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.090
We can't do that here.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:56.890
For the time being...

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.140
...let's go to the nurse's office,
where there's no one around!

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:10.070
Eruna... Eruna! Eruna!

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:16.740
Wait... We're doing a vision test with a
love letter in the nurse's office right now...

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.740
What delusions are you having?

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.910
Don't just lie around. At least decide
what school you're going to apply for.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.580
How many days do you think have passed
since the Golden Week holiday started?

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.580
I can still do my Golden Week!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.920
I mean, it's mine! I can do my week if I try!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.380
Don't talk like it's something
that you can do if you try.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.840
Jeez, how can you be so unconcerned about it?

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:41.510
That's not a compliment!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.060
I'm a week that does
better when complimented!

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.850
Don't talk like you're Golden Week!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.190
Anyway, once you're accepted somewhere,
I won't bug you anymore. Okay?

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.270
'Kay...

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.150
- Okay?
- 'Kay...

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:03.740
Well, did you decide where
you wanted to go, Eruna?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.750
Nope, not at all.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.330
What about that school in the next town?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.290
The uniforms aren't cute.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.540
That's your reason?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:15.460
That's important! If I have to wear an
ugly uniform, I might as well be a NEET!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.300
You can't be a NEET.

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:20.300
Then I'll be someone who
watches <i>Niconico</i> all day.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.970
I'll look for a job like that!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.020
There aren't any jobs like that.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:34.070
That's lame. Isn't there anything fun I can do?

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:02.680
Eruna! Eruna! Are you all right?

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.390
Yuriko...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:12.190
We're the only ones left, aren't we...?

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.030
Everything will be fine.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:23.490
Let's live on together in the world.
But before that...

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.540
...let's go to the nurse's office!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.300
In the end, you always
end up here, huh, Eruna?

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.590
Shigure, why are you here?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:46.140
I got permission to leave
the dorm just to see you, cutie.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.810
Don't make a face like that!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.900
Even if we're cousins,
the law says we can marry!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.320
Ew, gross.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.780
Well, what did you come here for?

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:06.160
I thought you probably hadn't
decided on a school to apply to yet.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.910
If that's the case, what about here?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.500
It's the school I go to, Mikagura Academy.

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:17.960
I see. Their uniforms <i>are</i> cute.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.750
Oh? Everyone lives in dorms?

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.920
And it only has cultural clubs...

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:26.050
It might be the only one like it in all Japan.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.720
By the way, I'm the president
of the manga research club.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:33.940
You're ignoring me?!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:39.070
Just a little is fine. If you'd just show
a little interest, it'd make me so happy.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.760
Eruna, you're drooling.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.800
An angel! She's such an angel!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.560
I can't believe a girl like
her exists in this world!

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:14.270
But models are usually used for
these kinds of pictures, right?

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.060
It's like the difference between the pictures
and the real thing at a burger joint.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.980
Burgers? I want to eat a teriyaki burger.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.190
You're not listening!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.570
By the way, the girl in the picture is the
principal's granddaughter, Seisa Mikagura.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:33.950
Okay, okay, you go and buy your
burger yourself. I want nugge...?!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.960
Wait, what? Say that again!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.500
I want to eat a teriyaki burger.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.790
Not that part!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.670
By the way, I'm the president
of the manga research club.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.420
You went back too far!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:48.220
The girl in the picture is the
principal's granddaughter, Seisa Mikagura.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.020
O, God!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.350
Um... Eruna?

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:59.600
- I've decided!
- Two girls can't marry each other, you know.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.230
Not that!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.360
I'm going to apply for this school!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.120
So this is where the entrance exams are?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.210
It's fine. Everything that I should have
done to prepare for today's exams...

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:29.680
...I was about to do, but didn't actually.
But I'm sure I'll be fine!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.930
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.270
What a delicate-looking maid!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.520
I love this!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.270
Can I take a picture?

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.650
Oh, shoot! I don't have my camera. Aw, man...

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:48.240
The preparations for the exams
have been completed. This way, please.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.110
She completely ignored me?

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:56.950
What a cool beauty! You're cool
and dreamy, so I'll call you Kurumi!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.170
Kurumi, have you worked here long?

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:05.670
Are you going out with anyone?
How about me? Just kidding!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.590
You will be taking the
written examination here.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.970
Uh, right...

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.180
What is with these questions?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.230
And she's sleeping!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:24.270
Is it a trap? Is there a catch?

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.230
Maybe I need to hold it up to the light?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.780
Or maybe reveal the invisible ink?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.490
Do a handstand?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.820
...eejit.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.660
Next is the interview.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.210
It's fine. Everything that I should have
done to prepare for today's interview...

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:49.510
Please enter.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.760
Huh?!

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:03.810
No one's here...?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.730
It doesn't look like she has it, ryui...

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.320
A direct descendant of
the main Ichinomiya family.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:21.250
You even got special treatment
during the test, but it's unfortunate.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:25.710
Even so, it's rare to see someone
as unfortunate as you, ryui.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.130
There's a limit to how
unfortunate someone can be, ryui.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.050
His eyes are his weakness. I see...

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.840
Don't "I see" me, ryui!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:41.560
To commit such an outrage upon cute
and lovely me! What a cruel child, ryui!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.640
Wh-What is with this creature?

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.770
Don't tell me it's another delusion? A dream?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.150
I'm not a dream or a delusion, ryui.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.400
You'll be able to tell if
you pinch your cheek, ryui...

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.120
What's the point of pinching <i>my</i> cheek, ryui?!

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.330
I'm your interviewer today, ryui!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.870
- What?!
- I am from Mikagura Private Academy—

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.500
You have a weird beaming look
on your face, so I'll call you Bimii!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.040
Don't give me a random name, ryui!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:10.750
Also, ending your sentences with "ryui" doesn't
really fit you. I think you should change it.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:18.600
R... Really, fwuff? Does this fit me, fwuff?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.180
Why don't you try "ug"?

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.350
That seems very unique, ug.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:29.400
No, no, no! It obviously comes
from the word "ugly," ug!

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.230
I don't really care,
but what about the interview?

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.740
Oh, right, ryui.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.110
We already have the interview result, ryui.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.240
Huh? But we didn't do anything yet...

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.040
Does that mean... I failed...?

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.910
Noooo!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.420
If this meaningless conversation was
the interview, then aren't I definitely out?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.710
And if the outs pile up, then aren't
I completely driven into a corner?

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.590
In baseball terms, it's the bottom of
the ninth with two outs, bases loaded.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.760
And I'm the batter, biding my time?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:55.590
Which means...

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.050
...I have a chance to turn things around!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.430
You're way too optimistic.

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:03.180
Huh? Does that mean it's
the end of the game after all?

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.970
Don't worry, ryui.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:08.440
You passed admirably, ryui.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:09.440
Why?

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:14.610
In the first place, just being able
to see me means you passed... ryui...

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.690
No way! It's not a dream, is it?

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.780
I told you, it's not a dream or a delusion, ryui!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.620
- I won't forgive you if you're lying! Hey!
- What's the point of pinching <i>my</i> cheek, ryui?!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.190
Huh?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:01.530
What?

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.410
What <i>is</i> this?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.540
It's a party to welcome the new students.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:14.880
One of the distinguishing features of this school
is that all students must belong to a club.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.380
These are clubs?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:45.070
It might be best to explain about Mikagura
Academy's special system—the club battles.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.080
Club battles?

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:50.410
Battles between clubs occur regularly,

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:54.040
and clubs are ranked based
on the results of those battles.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.840
If you are part of a strong club with a high rank,

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:01.380
you get preference for nice, large dorm rooms,

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.260
and you'll get better food, too, ryui!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.760
Really? I'm not sure what's going on...

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.190
...but it's like a festival. It looks fun!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:32.290
Wow, I didn't know there were this
many different kinds of cultural clubs.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.710
Speaking of which, I forgot
to give this to you, ryui.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.960
It's an original device
distributed to all the students, ryui.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.050
You can even do your shopping on this, ryui.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.680
Points are distributed based
on the results of the club battles,

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.890
so everything is taken care of with that, ryui.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:52.480
What? What's with that dream-like system?!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:58.440
This is the girls' dorm where you will
be sleeping every day from now on, ryui.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.110
Girls' dorm?!

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:02.240
Yuriko, I'm turning off the light.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.530
Y-You can't!

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.780
Either take off your clothes,
or have them taken off.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.080
Even if you say it like
those are the only choices...

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.960
Yoo-hoo, Teach! What are you
doing in a place like this?

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:21.090
Are you playing at being a dad who doesn't
want to go straight home after work?

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.800
So small and cute! Do you want
to live together? Under one roof?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.800
- C'mon, I'll feed you carrots every day!
- I'm not a rabbit!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.680
And I hate carrots! And I'm not small!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:36.480
She's the president of the
calligraphy club, Himi Yasaka, ryui.

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:37.480
Nice to meet you!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.650
Nice to meet you, Himi! I hope I
can meet you more than necessary!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:45.780
Let's be such close friends that
people misunderstand about us!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:50.870
Himi, it looks like Eruna's
been assigned to this dorm.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.330
Oh, in that case, I'll show you to your room!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.080
This is your room, Eruna!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.090
Huh? Room?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.300
My room is a sleeping bag?

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:06.880
If you aren't in a club,
then you don't have a room, ryui.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.010
What?!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.680
But don't worry.
That sleeping bag is really warm!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:15.020
Even if my body is warm,
my heart feels like it'll freeze...

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:19.600
Look, there's already a sleeping bag over
there with something shivering inside.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:26.030
I want to go home... I want to go home...

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:30.700
Yoo-hoo, come out! Won't you join
the calligraphy club that I'm in?

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:34.290
You can have a large private
room and delicious food!

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:48.130
U-Um... Is it really all right for someone
like me to join the calligraphy club?

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.340
I am just a beginner.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.220
Hello, hello!

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.430
I want to join the calligraphy club, too!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:00.310
Hmm, okay. Then...

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.900
...why don't I have you two
take a simple test to join?

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:05.360
It's okay if you're a beginner!

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:08.530
Calligraphy isn't about technique,
but about heart!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:13.740
Are you done?

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.450
Yes!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:20.290
Okay! Your strokes are nice, too. You pass!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.920
Yay! Thank you very much!

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:26.380
My name is Katai.
It's written as "flower" and "bag."

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.920
I'll work hard as a member
of the calligraphy club!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.800
Great, looking forward to it!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.800
Himi, I'm next!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.350
I can't read this...

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:39.230
Do you have some sort
of darkness in your heart?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.600
That's so mean!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:44.690
I'm sorry, Eruna, but you f-a-i-l-e-d.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:45.900
What?

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:50.280
The sleeping bag I was in is nice and
warmed up, so please feel free to use it!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.490
I don't want that kind of kindness!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.910
Let's go, Katai!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.740
Okay, Himi!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.750
Well, I'll be returning to my room now, too, ryui.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.960
I'll be back, ryui.

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.670
Hey, wait!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:14.260
I'm hungry... I wanna take a shower, too...

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:21.350
But it seems like things will get fun.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:30.860
I'm the homeroom teacher
for this class, Kurumi Narumi.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:35.160
Please call me Mistress Kurumi
as a sign of affection, okay?

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.410
No way, Kurumi?!
Kurumi from the entrance exams?!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.830
Now, let's start with self-introductions.

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.330
Student number 1, Eruna Ichinomiya.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.290
Here!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.050
Um... Hm?

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:54.180
I wrote that for you last night, ryui.
Just read it, ryui.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.680
Thanks, Bimii!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:18:00.890
Ahem. I'm Eruna Ichinomiya,
a trick star here from the outside

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:04.190
to throw a stone into the cogs
of the stagnating club battles!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.980
I'm not just at the top of the attendance sheet!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.030
If you want a sip of sweet liqueur,
invite me to join your club.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.740
Nice to meet you!

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.400
Huh?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:21.200
Th-Th-Th... This is all I have for lunch?!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.460
If you don't belong to a club,
you only get one side dish, ryui.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.290
- Huh?
- Oh, I forgot to tell you...

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.840
If you're not in a club,
you only get five minutes, ryui.

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.710
The water will stop automatically, ryui.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:39.260
What?! But I'm a girl! Even the
way I am, I'm still a teenage girl!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:43.600
You should just join a club for now, Eruna.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.650
Hmm... Oh, right! What club is she in?

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:50.230
Seisa Mikagura is in the going-home club.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.570
Going-home club? Is that even a club?

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.570
The going-home club gets special treatment

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.860
and hasn't accepted
applications for a while, ryui.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:02.830
Seisa just stays in the mansion
and hardly ever comes to school.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:17.050
I'm hungry...

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.430
In any case, you should visit different clubs.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.970
When you find one you like,
you can join for a trial period, ryui.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.190
I-I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.400
Why do you look like you're about to cry?

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:34.530
It makes me look like I'm bullying you.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.610
Th-That's not what I'm trying to do...

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.280
That's Kuzuryu from the art club.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.950
The one apologizing is Asuhi Imizu
from the astronomy club.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:50.790
Look. Thanks to you, we're the
center of attention, you girly rookie.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:55.130
That's not it. I just wanted to
apologize for bumping into you.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.300
Will you leave things at that?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:13.980
Kuzuryu, it's not something to
get so worked up about, is it?

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:18.690
Worked up? Don't be ridiculous.
I was just talking to him.

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:24.330
- Are you all right?
- Y-Yes.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.120
Thank you very much! You saved me!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:31.000
Kuzuryu is easily misunderstood
because of how he looks,

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.290
but he's not scary.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.340
Please don't hate him.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:44.180
Is she the one you found this time?

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.220
M-Me...? Is she talking to me?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.810
I still can't say, ryui.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:55.730
She might have possibilities on
a different vector from you, ryui.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.440
I see.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:07.080
If you haven't decided on a club to join yet,

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:10.290
will you join the going-home
club for a trial period?

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:12.620
Only if you feel so inclined, though.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.540
I do feel so inclined!
I feel so inclined right now!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.460
I mean, I have always felt so inclined!
In fact, I have since I was born!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.130
I feel so inclined with all my body and soul!

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.140
Then it's decided.

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:36.440
Oh, right. I completely forgot,
but there is a club battle next week.

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:40.730
Unfortunately, I'm planning
on being indisposed that day,

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:43.950
so please enter as the
going-home club representative.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.620
My goddess has invited me
to join the going-home club!

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.620
This isn't a delusion, right?

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.210
It's not a dream, either, right?

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:58.710
All right!

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:00.960
I have a feeling this is the start of a story...

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.050
...that will never fade!

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:45.030
And now, my lovey-dovey school life
with Eruna finally begins!

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:48.030
A true love that deepens
by overcoming all sorts of hardships!

00:23:48.240 --> 00:23:52.570
Then everyone in school gives
their blessing at our wonderful wedding!

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:55.240
All next time on "Romantic Honeymoon"!

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:57.450
Why're you making up
this fake preview, Shigure?!

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:58.410
Huh?! That wasn't right?!

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:02.710
It wasn't! Next time Seisa Mikagura,
that mysterious and beautiful

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:06.090
granddaughter of the principal—
who no doubt loves her dearly—

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:08.380
leads me into the forbidden girls' dorm!

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:11.680
And awaiting us there are
experiences like this, like that...

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:13.970
And whoa! Even like <i>that</i>!

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:16.060
Next time, "Secret Flower Garden Escalation!"

00:24:16.270 --> 00:24:18.600
Eruna, you're just making that up too, ryui!

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:19.770
Oh, it's weird Bimii.

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:23.610
I'm not weird, ryui!
Do the preview for real, ryui!

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:26.320
Eruna's ability finally awakens, ryui!

00:24:26.530 --> 00:24:28.740
Next time, it's "After-School Stride."
